single_choice: A "murmuration" is a collective noun for a large group of which animal?
!<hint>[Nudge me (-1)](They do it at dusk, over piers and reed beds, in shapes that look like smoke.)
{
=Starlings
~Bats
~Herring
~Wildebeest
}
