multiple_choice: Which of these countries have a coastline on the Mediterranean Sea?
!<analysis>[Why?](Slovenia's coast is only about 46 km long — the shortest on the Mediterranean of any country that has one — which is why it's so often missed.)
{
=Slovenia
=Albania
=Lebanon
~Portugal
~Bulgaria
}
:partial_credit=true
:points_correct=2
:points_wrong=-2
